second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is the director of the film \\\"Stranger than Fiction\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 139, \"text\": \"Stranger than Fiction (2000 film) Stranger Than Fiction is a 2000 comedy-thriller film directed by Eric Bross and starring Mackenzie Astin.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d00\", \"start\": 140, \"end\": 283, \"text\": \"While waiting for their flight in a bar of an airport, the writer Donovan Miller tells the story of his best-seller to a stranger to kill time.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d00\", \"start\": 284, \"end\": 380, \"text\": \"In Salt Lake City; Violet Madison, Austin Walker, Emma Scarlett and Jared Roth are good friends.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d00\", \"start\": 381, \"end\": 544, \"text\": \"After going together to a bar, Jared comes wounded to Austin's apartment in the late night and confesses that he is gay and has just killed a man in his apartment.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d00\", \"start\": 545, \"end\": 567, \"text\": \"He asks his friends to\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 89, \"text\": \"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia (Redirected from Stranger Than Fiction (2000 film))\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d01\", \"start\": 90, \"end\": 120, \"text\": \"2000 film by Quentin Tarantino\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d01\", \"start\": 122, \"end\": 179, \"text\": \"This article needs additional citations for verification.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d01\", \"start\": 180, \"end\": 233, \"text\": \"Please help improve this article by adding citations.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d01\", \"start\": 236, \"end\": 630, \"text\": \"3 languages Deutsch 한국어 Polski Edit links Article Talk English Read Edit View history Tools Tools move to sidebar hide Actions Read Edit View history General What links here Related changes Upload file Permanent link Page information Cite this page Get shortened URL Download QR code Print/export Download as PDF Printable version In other projects Wikidata item Appearance move to sidebar hide\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d01\", \"start\": 632, \"end\": 796, \"text\": \"Quentin Tarantino, known for his unique storytelling and stylistic approach, directed \\\"Stranger than Fiction,\\\" a film that blends elements of dark comedy and drama.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d01\", \"start\": 797, \"end\": 958, \"text\": \"The film, released in 2000, showcases Tarantino's signature style, featuring complex characters and a narrative that blurs the lines between reality and fiction.\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 179, \"text\": \"Stranger than Fiction (2006 film) Stranger than Fiction is a 2006 American fantasy comedy-drama film directed by Marc Forster, produced by Lindsay Doran, and written by Zach Helm.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d02\", \"start\": 180, \"end\": 277, \"text\": \"The film stars Will Ferrell, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Dustin Hoffman, Queen Latifah, and Emma Thompson.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d02\", \"start\": 278, \"end\": 565, \"text\": \"The main plot follows Harold Crick (Ferrell), an IRS worker who begins hearing a disembodied voice narrating his life as it happens – seemingly the text of a novel in which it is stated that he, the main character, will soon die – and he frantically seeks to somehow prevent that ending.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d02\", \"start\": 566, \"end\": 595, \"text\": \"The film was shot on location\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 195, \"text\": \"Man Called Otto ( 2022 ) White Bird ( 2024 ) Authority control databases International VIAF National Germany United States Norway Israel Retrieved from `` https : //en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php ?\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d03\", \"start\": 196, \"end\": 758, \"text\": \"title=Stranger_than_Fiction_ ( 2006_film ) & oldid=1282655677 `` Categories : 2006 films 2000s fantasy comedy-drama films American fantasy comedy-drama films Films about writers Films shot in Chicago American self-reflexive films Columbia Pictures films Mandate Pictures films Films directed by Marc Forster Films scored by Brian Reitzell Films set in Chicago Magic realism films Metafictional works 2000s English-language films 2000s American films English-language fantasy comedy-drama films English-language fantasy comedy films English-language fantasy drama\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0298-d97b005a2a5b:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Eric Bross\", \"scope\": \"Director of the 2000 film Stranger than Fiction\", \"claim\": \"Stranger than Fiction (2000 film) is a 2000 comedy-thriller film directed by Eric Bross.\", \"answer\": \"Eric Bross\", \"quote\": \"Stranger than Fiction (2000 film) Stranger Than Fiction is a 2000 comedy-thriller film directed by Eric Bross and starring Mac